{
  "rationale": "The plant models robot perception and motion capabilities, while the specification encodes a safe, coverage-oriented exploration policy. The supervisor alternates between random_walk and short forward moves in clear states, uses conservative turn recovery on obstacle detection, and only uses full_rotate as a last-resort scan. Each obstacle event leads to a dedicated turn state, and recovery returns to exploration as soon as the path is clear.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion: G1 for perception (sensor events), G2 for motion (action commands).",
    "Specification E1 encodes the exploration policy: random_walk in clear, move_forward in short bursts, turn recovery on obstacles, and minimal use of full_rotate."
  ],
